#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/animation.rst:2
msgid "animation"
msgstr "animation"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:1 of
msgid "动画基类"
msgstr "Base class of animations"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:3 of
msgid "定义了从 ``at`` 持续至 ``at + duration`` 的动画"
msgstr "Defines an animation that lasts from ``at`` to ``at + duration``"

#: ../../source/janim/anims_core/animation.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:5 of
msgid "动画的开始时间"
msgstr "The start time of the animation"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:6 of
msgid "动画的持续时间；可以是 ``FOREVER``，比如创建持续生效的 Updater"
msgstr "The duration of the animation; can be ``FOREVER``, for example, to create a continuously active Updater"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:7 of
msgid "设定插值函数，默认为 :meth:`~.rate_funcs.smooth`"
msgstr "Sets the interpolation function, defaulting to :meth:`~.rate_funcs.smooth`"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:8 of
msgid "更改在预览界面中时间轴标签上显示的名字，与画面渲染无关；若不设置则默认为类名"
msgstr ""
"Changes the name displayed on the timeline label in the preview interface. It does not affect rendering; if not set, it "
"defaults to the class name"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:12 of
msgid "动画对象不能复用，例如这样会导致意外行为："
msgstr "Animation objects cannot be reused, for example, this will cause unexpected behavior:"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:14 of
msgid ""
"anim1 = Transform(a, b)\n"
"anim2 = Transform(b, a)\n"
"self.play(anim1)\n"
"self.play(anim2)\n"
"self.play(anim1)"
msgstr ""
"anim1 = Transform(a, b)\n"
"anim2 = Transform(b, a)\n"
"self.play(anim1)\n"
"self.play(anim2)\n"
"self.play(anim1)"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:22 of
msgid "正确写法："
msgstr "Correct way:"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:24 of
msgid ""
"self.play(Transform(a, b))\n"
"self.play(Transform(b, a))\n"
"self.play(Transform(a, b))"
msgstr ""
"self.play(Transform(a, b))\n"
"self.play(Transform(b, a))\n"
"self.play(Transform(a, b))"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:30 of
msgid "JAnim 中动画区段的逻辑："
msgstr "The logic of animation intervals in JAnim:"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:32 of
msgid "刚创建出来的普通 :class:`Animation` 对象的 ``t_range``，会随着与 :class:`~.AnimGroup` 等动画组的嵌套而被调整"
msgstr ""
"The ``t_range`` of a newly created regular :class:`Animation` object will be adjusted as it is nested within animation "
"groups such as :class:`~.AnimGroup`"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation:34 of
msgid ""
"当最外层调用 :meth:`finalize` ，表示确定动画区段（会由 :meth:`~.Timeline.play` 或 :meth:`~.Timeline.prepare` 自动调用）， "
"则我们就认为动画区段得到确定，会进行浮点数对齐等操作，在这之后，就不应对 ``t_range`` 进行修改了"
msgstr ""
"When the outermost layer calls :meth:`finalize`, it indicates that the animation interval has been finalized (this is "
"automatically called by :meth:`~.Timeline.play` or :meth:`~.Timeline.prepare`). At this point, the animation interval is "
"considered fixed, and operations such as floating-point alignment are performed. After this, ``t_range`` should no longer "
"be modified"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation.shift_range:1 of
msgid "以 ``delta`` 的变化量移动时间区段"
msgstr "Shift the time-range by ``delta``"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation.scale_range:1 of
msgid "以 ``k`` 的倍率缩放时间区段（相对于 ``t=0`` 进行缩放）"
msgstr "Scale the time-range by factor ``k`` (scaled relative to ``t=0``)"

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.animation.Animation.force_order_ctx:1 of
msgid "用于强制指定所标记的动画顺序"
msgstr "Used to forcibly specify the order of the marked animation"

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.animation.Animation.force_order_ctx:3 of
msgid ""
"with ContextSetter(Animation.force_order_ctx, xxxanim._order):\n"
"    ..."
msgstr ""
"with ContextSetter(Animation.force_order_ctx, xxxanim._order):\n"
"    ..."

#: ../../docstring janim.anims_core.animation.Animation.force_order_ctx:8 of
msgid ""
"用于在延迟执行中，基于较早时刻的某个顺序来标记，从而使得 :class:`~.StackableAnimation` 动画能插入到动画堆栈中的合适位置"
msgstr ""
"Used to mark animations during delayed execution based on an order from an earlier time, "
"allowing :class:`~.StackableAnimation` animations to be inserted into the appropriate position in the animation stack"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation.finalize:1 of
msgid "让动画的区段确定下来，这会触发对时间区段的浮点数对齐（ 请参考 :class:`TimeAligner` ）以及一些其它标记"
msgstr ""
"Finalizes the animation interval. This triggers floating-point alignment of the time interval (see :class:`TimeAligner`) "
"and some other marking operations"

#: janim.anims_core.animation.Animation.transfer_params:1 of
msgid "将 ``other`` 中的动画参数，包括 ``t_range`` 和 ``rate_func(s)``， 同步到该动画对象上"
msgstr ""
"Synchronizes animation parameters from ``other``, including ``t_range`` and ``rate_func(s)``, to this animation object"

